  "summary": "The aesthetic emerged as a reaction against the polished \" metrosexual \" look of the early 2000s, emphasizing a return to a more traditional and rugged form of masculinity.",
  "description": "The aesthetic emerged as a reaction against the polished \" metrosexual \" look of the early 2000s, emphasizing a return to a more traditional and rugged form of masculinity. It romanticizes a lifestyle of authenticity, self-reliance, and a connection to nature, even when adopted by men in urban environments who have no connection to manual labor. [ 2 ]",
  "culturalContext": "Key values (per the Aesthetics Wiki): Authenticity, ruggedness, masculinity, craftsmanship, durability, connection to nature",
